# Operational reports/data that embed real prospect contact info (names,
# emails) inline in prose or JSON -- same reasoning as
# outreach/data/outreach-log.csv (see outreach/data/.gitignore): these are
# working files with PII, not source of truth for the product, and don't
# belong in permanent git history. Added 2026-08-24 when a git-tracking
# audit found decades of untracked files -- most were fine to add (source
# code, policy docs with 0-1 incidental email mentions), these were not
# (14-31 unique prospect emails each).
/briefings/
/kpi/
/launch-checklist.md
/outreach/policy/decision-log-*.md
/outreach/drafts/
/outreach/ready/
/outreach/data/crm-reconciliation-*.json
/outreach/data/deliverability-snapshots/
/outreach/data/gate-status*.json
/outreach/data/experiment-status*.json
/outreach/data/task-queue*.json
